  pages (`js_meanshift`, `js_camshift`, `js_optical_flow_lucas_kanade`),
  all of which are also blocked on CamShift/meanShift/calcOpticalFlowPyrLK
  themselves being unbound (see the other opencvjs-* entries below).

    import('opencv').then(cv => {
      new cv.TermCriteria(cv.TERM_CRITERIA_EPS | cv.TERM_CRITERIA_COUNT, 10, 1);
      // TypeError: not a function
    });

